SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 95 taxa with 7 partitions and 16554 total sites (0% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	95	1108	127	72	976	976	control_region
   2	DNA	95	2512	53	24	2459	2459	rRNA
   3	DNA	95	1504	41	14	1467	1467	tRNA
   4	DNA	95	3785	93	39	3686	3686	cds_pos1
   5	DNA	95	3780	47	9	3736	3736	cds_pos2
   6	DNA	95	3776	191	90	3530	3530	cds_pos3
   7	DNA	95	89	9	3	84	84	noncoding_other

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: K3Pu+F+R3:control_region,HKY+F+I:rRNA,HKY+F+I:tRNA,TN+F+I:cds_pos1,HKY+F:cds_pos2,TIM2+F+G4:cds_pos3,HKY+F:noncoding_other

List of best-fit models per partition:

  ID  Model                  LogL         AIC      w-AIC        AICc     w-AICc         BIC      w-BIC
